: false, "lastModified": "2024-03-25T08:09:46.000Z", "likes": 0, "trendingScore": 0, "private": false, "sha": "62f620fcb5614b21445678ea866acfe68cbac8d7", "downloads": 7, "tags": ["size_categories:10K<n<100K", "format:parquet", "modality:text", "library:datasets", "library:pandas", "library:mlcroissant", "library:polars", "region:us"], "createdAt": "2024-03-25T07:58:20.000Z", "key": ""}, {"_id": "6889898a84d9753485f86f48", "id": "dkqjrm/klue-ner-converted", "author": "dkqjrm", "disabled": false, "gated": false, "lastModified": "2025-07-30T03:08:09.000Z", "likes": 0, "trendingScore": 0, "private": false, "sha": "fc02c94eb5720521ba148737365f38814f88ccf8", "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tKLUE NER Dataset - Converted Format\n\t\n\nThis dataset is converted from the original KLUE NER dataset with entity tags in the format <|B_LABEL|>entity<|E_LABEL|>.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Structure\n\t\n\n\ntrain: 21,008 examples\nvalidation: 5,000 examples\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tFormat Conversion\n\t\n\nOriginal format: <entity:label>\nConverted format: <|B_LABEL|>entity<|E_LABEL|>\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEntity Tags Used\n\t\n\nThe following entity tags are used in this dataset:\n\nDT: Date (Begin/End tags <|B_DT|> and <|E_DT|>)\nLC:\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/dkqjrm/klue-ner-converted.", "downloads": 6, "tags": ["size_categories:10K<n<100K", "format:parquet", "modality:text", "library:datasets", "library:pandas", "library:mlcroissant", "library:polars", "arxiv:2105.09680", "region:us"], "createdAt": "2025-07-30T02:55:06.000Z", "key": ""}, {"_id": "6889950d8d2191791be5dd04", "id": "dkqjrm/klue-ner-fixed", "author": "dkqjrm", "disabled": false, "gated": false, "lastModified": "2025-07-30T03:44:21.000Z", "likes": 0, "trendingScore": 0, "private": false, "sha": "abb6cada77adac5571f04c479a7d996186d63d77", "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tKLUE NER Dataset - Fixed Converted Format\n\t\n\nThis dataset is converted from the original KLUE NER dataset with entity tags in the format <|B_LABEL|>entity<|E_LABEL|>.\nKey improvements:\n\nOnly valid NER labels are used: DT, LC, OG, PS, QT, TI\nMalformed labels are normalized (e.g., <23:39:TI> \u2192 <|B_TI|>23:39<|E_TI|>)\nEntity content is preserved exactly as in the original text\nDuplicate label prefixes are removed (e.g., <OG \ubd80\ucc9c\uc9c0\uccad:OG> \u2192 <|B_OG|>\ubd80\ucc9c\uc9c0\uccad<|E_OG|>)\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Structure\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/dkqjrm/klue-ner-fixed.", "downloads": 12, "tags": ["size_categories:10K<n<100K", "format:parquet", "modality:text", "library:datasets", "library:pandas", "library:mlcroissant", "library:polars", "arxiv:2105.09680", "region:us"], "createdAt": "2025-07-30T03:44:13.000Z", "key": ""}]